    "issues": [
      "Ambiguity: the question asks 'vilken riksdagsfunktion kan granska regeringens arbete?' but both Konstitutionsutskottet (option 0, correct) and Justitieombudsmannen/JO (option 1) are Riksdag-linked bodies that can examine minister conduct. A well-prepared learner could reasonably pick JO, creating a near-tie. Narrow the question to a committee so only KU fits."
    ],
    "suggestedQuestionSv": "Vilket riksdagsutskott granskar hur ministrar och regeringen sköter sina uppgifter?",
