    "suggestedCorrectIndex": 0,
    "suggestedExplanationEn": "The Committee on the Constitution (Konstitutionsutskottet, KU) is the Riksdag committee that scrutinizes how ministers and the government handle their duties. JO handles individual complaints about authorities; Lagrådet reviews the legality of bills; Riksrevisionen audits public finances.",
    "difficultySuggestion": "hard"
